note_content":"師古曰：言如牟賊之食苗也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：言如牟贼之食苗也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":77,"tongjian_id":"903e967a-db0e-11ef-911d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"班","people_name_jianti_auto":"班","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"903e967d-db0e-11ef-8a8c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"海西縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"海西县","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"903e967e-db0e-11ef-884f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東海郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"东海郡","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"903e967f-db0e-11ef-80b1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"班志，海西縣屬東海郡。","note_content_jianti_auto":"班志，海西县属东海郡。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":109,"tongjian_id":"903e967c-db0e-11ef-9444-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"新畤侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"新畤侯","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"903e9682-db0e-11ef-94c7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"903e9683-db0e-11ef-816a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"功臣表，新畤侯食邑於齊地。畤，音止。","note_content_jianti_auto":"功臣表，新畤侯食邑于齐地。畤，音止。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":117,"tongjian_id":"903e9681-db0e-11ef-a80f-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"孟康","people_name_jianti_auto":"孟康","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"903e9686-db0e-11ef-a71e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"孟康曰：奮，迅也，自樂而行者。","note_content_jianti_auto":"孟康曰：奋，迅也，自乐而行者。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":165,"tongjian_id":"903e9685-db0e-11ef-8c65-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"903e9688-db0e-11ef-868b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：言以罪謫而行者，免其所犯，不敍其勞。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：言以罪谪而行者，免其所犯，不敍其劳。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":175,"tongjian_id":"903e9687-db0e-11ef-a196-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"903e968a-db0e-11ef-94cf-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：或以他財物充之，故云直。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：或以他财物充之，故云直。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":183,"tongjian_id":"903e9689-db0e-11ef-a1ce-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"軍事指揮","official_name":"貳師將軍","official_note":"貳師將軍是漢武帝時期設置的將軍名號，李廣利曾任此職，負責遠征大宛等軍事行動。在《資治通鑑》此段中，貳師將軍指李廣利，他率軍征伐大宛後返回京師，上下文描述其軍事行動及封賞情況。","official_rank":"高級將領","source_snippet":"貳師將軍來至京師","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"fd8a2744-4ebb-4595-8124-c5ef4ce495ea"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"爵位","official_name":"海西侯","official_note":"海西侯是漢代封爵，李廣利因征伐大宛之功受封此爵，屬於軍功封賞。在《資治通鑑》此段中，這是天子下詔對李廣利的封賞，體現其戰功。","official_rank":"侯爵","source_snippet":"封李廣利爲海西侯","start_index":88,"tongjian_id":"d2dde938-de61-413f-9cf6-9d5d3d9054ae"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"爵位","official_name":"新畤侯","official_note":"新畤侯是漢代封爵，趙弟因從軍征伐受封此爵。在《資治通鑑》此段中，這是天子下詔對趙弟的封賞，作為軍功獎勵的一部分。","official_rank":"侯爵","source_snippet":"封趙弟爲新畤侯","start_index":96,"tongjian_id":"d0860315-7365-4e6b-b5d1-0aa849b75a5a"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"財政","official_name":"少府","official_note":"少府是秦漢時期九卿之一，掌管皇室財政和山海池澤之稅。在《資治通鑑》此段中，上官桀被任命為少府，這是對其軍功的升遷賞賜。","official_rank":"九卿","source_snippet":"以上官桀爲少府","start_index":104,"tongjian_id":"94ac6984-c50f-4b7f-aa51-9c06066245cb"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"中樞機構","official_name":"九卿","official_note":"九卿是漢代中央政府的九個高級官職，包括太常、光祿勳等，負責國家重要事務。在《資治通鑑》此段中，指軍中官吏有三人被任命為九卿，作為對軍功的封賞。","official_rank":"高級官員","source_snippet":"軍官吏爲九卿者三人","start_index":112,"tongjian_id":"82063f83-dde4-443b-a66f-2ff86be4a987"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"諸侯相","official_note":"諸侯相是漢代諸侯國的丞相，負責輔佐諸侯王治理封國。在《資治通鑑》此段中，這是對軍功人員的封賞職位之一，屬於高級地方官。","official_rank":"二千石","source_snippet":"諸侯相、郡守、二千石百餘人","start_index":122,"tongjian_id":"906422db-e4ea-4030-87eb-d1b5afe7d588"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"郡守","official_note":"郡守是漢代郡級行政長官，負責一郡的政務。在《資治通鑑》此段中，這是對軍功人員的封賞職位之一，體現廣泛的獎勵。","official_rank":"二千石","source_snippet":"諸侯相、郡守、二千石百餘人","start_index":127,"tongjian_id":"dfc37a60-2bf3-41b7-ae17-c4b198b0d0ac"},{"confidence":0.8,"official_category":"官秩","official_name":"二千石","official_note":"二千石是漢代官員的俸祿等級，對應高級官職如郡守、九卿等。在《資治通鑑》此段中，指受封賞的官員中有百餘人達到二千石級別，強調封賞規模。","official_rank":"高級官員","source_snippet":"諸侯相、郡守、二千石百餘人","start_index":130,"tongjian_id":"4bbf182d-f64b-4852-adf3-ca3b436d7f6d"},{"confidence":0.8,"official_category":"官秩","official_name":"千石","official_note":"千石是漢代官員的俸祿等級，對應中級官職。在《資治通鑑》此段中，指受封賞的官員中還有千餘人屬於千石及以下級別，進一步說明封賞範圍之廣。","official_rank":"中級官員","source_snippet":"千石以下千餘人","start_index":140,"tongjian_id":"67b7f29a-e007-4897-b5bf-54415ecdd35f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-135,"link_death_year":-89,"link_td_description":"李广利，西汉时期将军，中山（今河北定州）人，汉武帝宠姬李夫人和宠臣李延年的哥哥。后来兵败投降匈奴，后被卫律猜忌而被杀害。","link_td_id":"Q10004232","link_td_number_id":215075,"people_name":"貳師","people_name_jianti_auto":"贰师","people_xingming":"李广利","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"903e968b-db0e-11ef-9cb0-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-135,"link_death_year":-89,"link_td_description":"李广利，西汉时期将军，中山（今河北定州）人，汉武帝宠姬李夫人和宠臣李延年的哥哥。后来兵败投降匈奴，后被卫律猜忌而被杀害。","link_td_id":"Q10004232","link_td_number_id":215075,"people_name":"李廣利","people_name_jianti_auto":"李广利","people_xingming":"李广利","start_index":101,"tongjian_id":"903e968f-db0e-11ef-9ee8-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-135,"link_death_year":-89,"link_td_description":"李广利，西汉时期将军，中山（今河北定州）人，汉武帝宠姬李夫人和宠臣李延年的哥哥。后来兵败投降匈奴，后被卫律猜忌而被杀害。","link_td_id":"Q10004232","link_td_number_id":215075,"people_name":"海西侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"海西侯","people_xingming":"李广利","start_index":105,"tongjian_id":"903e9690-db0e-11ef-80a6-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"趙弟","people_name_jianti_auto":"赵弟","people_xingming":"赵弟","start_index":110,"tongjian_id":"903e9691-db0e-11ef-a8c9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"新畤侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"新畤侯","people_xingming":"赵弟","start_index":113,"tongjian_id":"903e9692-db0e-11ef-a8c3-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-80,"link_td_description":"上官桀，西汉陇西郡上邽县（在今甘肃省天水市清水县境）人，汉武帝、汉昭帝时官员。有子上官安，孙女上官氏为汉昭帝的皇后，亦是霍光的外孙女。","link_td_id":"Q10008807","link_td_number_id":384120,"people_name":"上官桀","people_name_jianti_auto":"上官桀","people_xingming":"上官桀","start_index":118,"tongjian_id":"903e9693-db0e-11ef-af1f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"903e9672-db0e-11ef-91b2-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"móu","source_anchor_text":"不愛卒侵牟之以此物","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":74,"text":"牟","tongjian_id":"eef5a1ef-7d9d-56fc-b77a-f8764d7824a5"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"貳師","place_name_jianti_auto":"贰师","resolved_place_entity_id":2062,"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"903e968c-db0e-11ef-b007-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"京師","place_name_jianti_auto":"京师","place_note":"长安，陕西西安","resolved_place_entity_id":43,"start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"903e968d-db0e-11ef-b503-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"宛","place_name_jianti_auto":"宛","place_note":"都贵山城，中亚纳曼干市西北卡散赛城","resolved_place_entity_id":377,"start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"903e968e-db0e-11ef-9abb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"汉攻大宛之战","tongjian_id":"war_N0584"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事","军事"],"content":"1春，貳師將軍來至京師。貳師所過小國聞宛破，皆使其子弟從入貢獻，見天子，因爲質焉。軍還，入馬千餘匹。後行，軍非乏食，戰死不甚多，而將吏貪，不愛卒，侵牟之，以此物故者衆。天子爲萬里而伐，不錄其過，乃下詔封李廣利爲海西侯，封趙弟爲新畤侯，以上官桀爲少府，軍官吏爲九卿者三人，諸侯相、郡守、二千石百餘人，千石以下千餘人，奮行者官過其望，以謫過行，皆黜其勞，士卒賜直四萬錢。","content_fanyi":"春季，贰师将军李广利回到京城长安。李广利一路经过的西域小国听说大宛已经被攻破，都让本国子弟跟着他入京进贡，朝见汉武帝，并留在长安充当人质。大军回师进入玉门关时，带回来的马有一千多匹。此次再度出征，军中并不缺粮，战死的人也不算多，只因将领和官吏贪婪，不爱惜士卒，侵夺虐待他们，所以死亡的人很多。汉武帝因为李广利远赴万里征伐，不追究他的过失，下诏封李广利为海西侯，封赵弟为新畤侯，任命上官桀为少府，军官担任九卿的有三人，担任诸侯国相、郡守、二千石官职的一百多人，担任一千石及以下官职的一千多人，自愿随军出征的人所授官职都超过他们原本的期望，因罪过被罚出征的人一律免罪而不记功劳，赏赐给士卒的财物价值四万钱。","content_jianti_auto":"1春，贰师将军来至京师。贰师所过小国闻宛破，皆使其子弟从入贡献，见天子，因为质焉。军还，入马千余匹。后行，军非乏食，战死不甚多，而将吏贪，不爱卒，侵牟之，以此物故者众。天子为万里而伐，不录其过，乃下诏封李广利为海西侯，封赵弟为新畤侯，以上官桀为少府，军官吏为九卿者三人，诸侯相、郡守、二千石百余人，千石以下千余人，奋行者官过其望，以谪过行，皆黜其劳，士卒赐直四万钱。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1747,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"903e9672-db0e-11ef-91b2-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"903e9696-db0e-11ef-920d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：以其言爲直。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：以其言为直。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":115,"tongjian_id":"903e9695-db0e-11ef-b8a4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"貳師","official_note":"貳師是漢武帝時期李廣利的官職，指貳師將軍，負責征伐大宛等軍事行動，在上下文中表示李廣利率軍出征。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"匈奴聞貳師征大宛","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8d04cfb1-cde6-4cbf-bf08-d7d314276587"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"樓蘭王","official_note":"樓蘭王是西域樓蘭國的君主，在上下文中被漢軍捕獲並帶到朝廷責問，反映了漢朝對西域的控制。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"捕樓蘭王","start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"a298462d-b23d-4eee-941c-ea2376c37508"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-135,"link_death_year":-89,"link_td_description":"李广利，西汉时期将军，中山（今河北定州）人，汉武帝宠姬李夫人和宠臣李延年的哥哥。后来兵败投降匈奴，后被卫律猜忌而被杀害。","link_td_id":"Q10004232","link_td_number_id":215075,"people_name":"貳師","people_name_jianti_auto":"贰师","people_xingming":"李广利","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"903e9698-db0e-11ef-bfa0-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[李广利]"},{"link_birth_year":-135,"link_death_year":-89,"link_td_description":"李广利，西汉时期将军，中山（今河北定州）人，汉武帝宠姬李夫人和宠臣李延年的哥哥。后来兵败投降匈奴，后被卫律猜忌而被杀害。","link_td_id":"Q10004232","link_td_number_id":215075,"people_name":"貳師","people_name_jianti_auto":"贰师","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"903e9699-db0e-11ef-892c-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[李广利]"},{"people_name":"任文","people_name_jianti_auto":"任文","people_xingming":"任文","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"903e969a-db0e-11ef-9ca7-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"文","people_name_jianti_auto":"文","people_xingming":"任文","start_index":65,"tongjian_id":"903e969b-db0e-11ef-8675-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"樓蘭王","people_name_jianti_auto":"楼兰王","people_xingming":"楼兰王","start_index":71,"tongjian_id":"903e969c-db0e-11ef-b276-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"匈奴","place_name_jianti_auto":"匈奴","resolved_place_entity_id":104,"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"903e969d-db0e-11ef-81ac-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"大宛","place_name_jianti_auto":"大宛","resolved_place_entity_id":377,"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"903e969e-db0e-11ef-8e87-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"樓蘭","place_name_jianti_auto":"楼兰","resolved_place_entity_id":1784,"start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"903e969f-db0e-11ef-ad96-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","resolved_place_entity_id":9,"start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"903e96a0-db0e-11ef-9e0f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","resolved_place_entity_id":9,"start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"903e96a1-db0e-11ef-80e1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"玉門關","place_name_jianti_auto":"玉门关","place_note":"甘肃敦煌西北","resolved_place_entity_id":2935,"start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"903e96a2-db0e-11ef-a80c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","resolved_place_entity_id":9,"start_index":106,"tongjian_id":"903e96a3-db0e-11ef-8599-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"匈奴","place_name_jianti_auto":"匈奴","resolved_place_entity_id":104,"start_index":124,"tongjian_id":"903e96a4-db0e-11ef-9780-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"匈奴","place_name_jianti_auto":"匈奴","resolved_place_entity_id":104,"start_index":127,"tongjian_id":"903e96a5-db0e-11ef-9c07-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"樓蘭","place_name_jianti_auto":"楼兰","resolved_place_entity_id":1784,"start_index":135,"tongjian_id":"903e96a6-db0e-11ef-a2dd-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"汉攻大宛之战","tongjian_id":"war_N0584"},{"title":"汉匈战争","tongjian_id":"war_N0568"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十三、西宁卫（卷六十四）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"后汉建武中，闭玉门关，谢西域之质。《后·西域传》：自敦煌...","context_before":"...县西北百十八里。汉武使霍去病破走月支，开玉门关，通西域。","source_end_index":115,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"23e2d8a3-0e3b-5e62-bf03-9dae4ba5d5c8","source_start_index":71,"source_text":"太初初，李广利伐宛，不克。使使遮玉门曰：军有敢入者，辄斩之。又遣军正任文屯玉门关，是也。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/十三、西宁卫（卷六十四）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事","外交"],"content":"匈奴聞貳師征大宛，欲遮之，貳師兵盛，不敢當，卽遣騎因樓蘭候漢使後過者，欲絕勿通。時漢軍正任文將兵屯玉門關，捕得生口，知狀以聞。上詔文便道引兵捕樓蘭王，將詣闕簿責。王對曰：「小國在大國間，不兩屬無以自安，願徙國入居漢地。」上直其言，遣歸國，亦因使候司匈奴，匈奴自是不甚親信樓蘭。","content_fanyi":"匈奴听说贰师将军李广利率兵征讨大宛，想要拦截他；但见贰师所率军队兵势强盛，匈奴不敢正面抵挡，就派骑兵前往楼兰，等候袭击后面经过的汉朝使节，企图断绝他们的往来通道。当时汉军军正任文正率兵屯驻玉门关，捕获了匈奴俘虏，得知这一情况后奏报朝廷。汉武帝下诏，命任文就近领兵捉拿楼兰王，押送到长安宫阙前审问责处。楼兰王分辩说：“楼兰只是一个小国，夹在汉朝与匈奴两个大国之间，如果不两边听命，就无法自保平安，情愿率领本国百姓迁入汉朝境内居住。”汉武帝认为他的话有理，便遣送他回国，也借此让他侦察匈奴的动静，从此匈奴对楼兰国不再十分信任。","content_jianti_auto":"匈奴闻贰师征大宛，欲遮之，贰师兵盛，不敢当，即遣骑因楼兰候汉使后过者，欲绝勿通。时汉军正任文将兵屯玉门关，捕得生口，知状以闻。上诏文便道引兵捕楼兰王，将诣阙簿责。王对曰：「小国在大国间，不两属无以自安，愿徙国入居汉地。」上直其言，遣归国，亦因使候司匈奴，匈奴自是不甚亲信楼兰。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1748,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"903e9694-db0e-11ef-87fd-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[{"chapter_global_index":15,"chapter_name":"边事篇第十五","chenzhu_chapter":"边事犹今言国际之事，息息与本国相通，不可不知己知彼者也。南宋国势孱弱，百年大计，争持于和战之间，结果和与战皆失，驯至亡国，可慨也已！身之所论，大抵重在自强自治，不与人以可乘之机。纵不得已而求助于人，亦必慎所与而毋贻拒虎进狼之悔，斯可谓善于交邻者矣。","chenzhu_index_in_chapter":3,"chenzhu_text":"宋南渡之初，使臣聘金者，每被抑留，强使拜职，如司马朴、朱弁、王伦、宇文虚中之徒是也。朴、弁在元遗山《中州集》南冠五人中，伦、虚中则《宋、金史》皆有传。身之以颜说为非者，盖有感于此。德祐之末，参政家铉翁亦以奉使被留二十年，强授以官不拜，元人高之，元贞元年乃放还，此身之所亲见也，故益不以颜说为然。","created_at":"2025-12-31 08:50:44","seq_in_chapter":10,"tongjian_id":"CH15-CZ003"}],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"903e96a9-db0e-11ef-8edf-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"顏","people_name_jianti_auto":"颜","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"903e96aa-db0e-11ef-993b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"903e96ab-db0e-11ef-a664-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"西域","place_name_jianti_auto":"西域","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"903e96ac-db0e-11ef-860d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：賞其勤勞，皆得拜職也。余謂顏說非也，此言漢使入西域，諸國不敢輕辱，爲得其職耳。得職者，不失其職也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：赏其勤劳，皆得拜职也。余谓颜说非也，此言汉使入西域，诸国不敢轻辱，为得其职耳。得职者，不失其职也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"903e96a8-db0e-11ef-9c00-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"渠犂","place_name_jianti_auto":"渠犂","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"903e96ae-db0e-11ef-ba58-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"輪臺","place_name_jianti_auto":"轮台","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"903e96af-db0e-11ef-82ce-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"且末","place_name_jianti_auto":"且末","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"903e96b0-db0e-11ef-b0c6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"精絕","place_name_jianti_auto":"精绝","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"903e96b1-db0e-11ef-8e17-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"渠犂在輪臺東，東南與且末接，南與精絕接。","note_content_jianti_auto":"渠犂在轮台东，东南与且末接，南与精绝接。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"903e96ad-db0e-11ef-ab93-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"903e96b3-db0e-11ef-ae64-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：統領保護屯田之事也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：统领保护屯田之事也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"903e96b2-db0e-11ef-9d9e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"903e96b5-db0e-11ef-a802-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：收其五穀以供之。使，疏吏翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：收其五谷以供之。使，疏吏翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":65,"tongjian_id":"903e96b4-db0e-11ef-bf69-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"使者","official_note":"使者是漢朝派往西域的官員，負責外交、監護和協調事務，在《資治通鑑》此段中，設置使者以管理和支持對外國的事務，體現漢朝對西域的控制和影響力擴張。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"置使者、校尉領護","start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"4038e427-8c30-4e47-b238-c47bcc082193"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"軍事指揮","official_name":"校尉","official_note":"校尉是漢朝的軍事官職，通常負責指揮軍隊或特定區域的防務，在《資治通鑑》此段中，校尉與使者一同被設置，以領護西域地區，加強軍事管理和保護漢朝利益。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"置使者、校尉領護","start_index":51,"tongjian_id":"c5a60bf3-d77d-4e12-9ec2-b955032fbda1"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"大宛","place_name_jianti_auto":"大宛","resolved_place_entity_id":377,"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"903e96b6-db0e-11ef-8485-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"西域","place_name_jianti_auto":"西域","resolved_place_entity_id":259,"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"903e96b7-db0e-11ef-a23f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","resolved_place_entity_id":9,"start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"903e96b8-db0e-11ef-8052-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"西域","place_name_jianti_auto":"西域","resolved_place_entity_id":259,"start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"903e96b9-db0e-11ef-bdbf-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"敦煌","place_name_jianti_auto":"敦煌","resolved_place_entity_id":334,"start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"903e96ba-db0e-11ef-b047-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鹽澤","place_name_jianti_auto":"盐泽","place_note":"羅布泊","resolved_place_entity_id":3051,"start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"903e96bb-db0e-11ef-bc32-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"輪臺","place_name_jianti_auto":"轮台","resolved_place_entity_id":2526,"start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"903e96bc-db0e-11ef-839c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"渠犂","place_name_jianti_auto":"渠犂","resolved_place_entity_id":2913,"start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"903e96bd-db0e-11ef-918b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"汉攻大宛之战","tongjian_id":"war_N0584"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二、两汉 三国（卷二）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"三十六国，俱在今甘肃徼外。敦煌，今废沙州卫。盐泽，在其西...","context_before":"...通西南夷。今陕西、四川以西南及贵州、云南之境，是其地]，","source_end_index":488,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"4d6cf127-4426-5d4e-8a0e-13e9d3b01528","source_start_index":427,"source_text":"又通西域[元鼎二年，武帝从张骞言，招乌孙、大夏之属三十六国，自敦煌西至盐泽、轮台、渠犁，皆起亭障，有田卒，置使者校尉领护。"}],"path":"历代州域形势纪要/二、两汉 三国（卷二）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十三、西宁卫（卷六十四）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"汉张骞言：于阗之西，水皆西流，注西海。其东水东流，注盐泽...","context_before":"...三百里。一名盐泽。广袤三四百里，则葱岭、于阗两河之所注。","source_end_index":60,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"4e009076-6edf-53bc-9144-b88f6150d181","source_start_index":41,"source_text":"汉大初中，自敦煌西至盐泽，往往起亭鄣。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/十三、西宁卫（卷六十四）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十四、哈密卫（卷六十五）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"唐因置轮台县，属庭州。后没于吐蕃。咸通七年，北庭回鹘仆固...","context_before":"...，李广利伐宛，至轮台，不下，攻屠之。自是而西，平行至宛。","source_end_index":86,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"f9a5bdf1-4855-519b-9264-fc58d581bf15","source_start_index":53,"source_text":"又轮台、渠犁皆有汉田卒。武帝轮台之悔，谓轮台西于车师千余里，是也。"},{"context_after":"太初中，以伐宛不克，则乌孙、轮台，易苦汉使，为外国笑，乃...","context_before":"...尉犁、东南与且末、南与精绝接。西有河，去龟兹五百八十里。","source_end_index":70,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"d52d0584-d49d-5cfa-ba80-a1e70efea1fb","source_start_index":56,"source_text":"武帝通西域，置校尉屯田渠犁。"},{"context_after":"征和中，桑弘羊言故轮台以东，捷枝、渠犁，皆故国地。广饶水...","context_before":"...。西有河，去龟兹五百八十里。武帝通西域，置校尉屯田渠犁。","source_end_index":123,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"d52d0584-d49d-5cfa-ba80-a1e70efea1fb","source_start_index":70,"source_text":"太初中，以伐宛不克，则乌孙、轮台，易苦汉使，为外国笑，乃益兵伐宛。大宛破后，西域震慑，轮台、渠犁皆有田卒。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/十四、哈密卫（卷六十五）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["内政","外交"],"content":"自大宛破後，西域震懼，漢使入西域者益得職。於是自敦煌西至鹽澤往往起亭，而輪臺、渠犂皆有田卒數百人，置使者、校尉領護，以給使外國者。","content_fanyi":"自从大宛被攻破以后，西域各国震动恐惧，派往西域的汉朝使者因此越发能够顺利完成使命。于是自敦煌向西直到盐泽，沿途处处修筑亭燧；而轮台、渠犁都有屯田的汉朝士兵数百人，并设置使者、校尉统领护卫，用来供应出使外国的使团所需。","content_jianti_auto":"自大宛破后，西域震惧，汉使入西域者益得职。于是自敦煌西至盐泽往往起亭，而轮台、渠犂皆有田卒数百人，置使者、校尉领护，以给使外国者。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1749,"reading_annotatio